    "detailed_description": "<strong>Run like it's the 90s!</strong><br><br>Underpowered Night Spooks is settled in Japan's countryside, the place where cars from the 1980s and 1990s became legendary. Pick a car and find an opponent for a one-versus-one battle.<br><br><strong>Unique cars</strong><br><br>Power, weight, and drivetrain type are not random numbers and acronyms that tell you which car is faster; they have real meaning and will affect the physics of the car. Each one has a unique feeling; find your own style.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer battles</strong><br><br>The game features a singleplayer time attack mode and is mainly focused on 1v1 PVP online matches. Call a friend or find your rival online and put your skills to the test!<br><br><strong>Automatics vs Manual</strong><br><br>Automatic cars are automatic, and manual cars are manual. There's no way to play with a manual car without shifting gears, or vice versa.<br><br><strong>Get your keyboard ready!</strong><br><br>The game is meant to be played with a keyboard without giving away the car's physics or its immersion.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Run like it's the 90s!</strong><br><br>Underpowered Night Spooks is settled in Japan's countryside, the place where cars from the 1980s and 1990s became legendary. Pick a car and find an opponent for a one-versus-one battle.<br><br><strong>Unique cars</strong><br><br>Power, weight, and drivetrain type are not random numbers and acronyms that tell you which car is faster; they have real meaning and will affect the physics of the car. Each one has a unique feeling; find your own style.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer battles</strong><br><br>The game features a singleplayer time attack mode and is mainly focused on 1v1 PVP online matches. Call a friend or find your rival online and put your skills to the test!<br><br><strong>Automatics vs Manual</strong><br><br>Automatic cars are automatic, and manual cars are manual. There's no way to play with a manual car without shifting gears, or vice versa.<br><br><strong>Get your keyboard ready!</strong><br><br>The game is meant to be played with a keyboard without giving away the car's physics or its immersion.",
    "short_description": "Underpowered Night Spooks is a racing game that takes place in Japan in the early 1990s. Challenge a friend or an online player to a one-to-one race on tough courses where any distraction can cost your victory.",
